    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Charming 3 bedroom home in the heart of Camolin.\r\n\r\nNo. 5 Limerick Road Lower is a traditional two-storey residence ideally located within walking distance of all village amenities in Camolin. This well established home offers a solid layout with three bedrooms, a front sitting room and a rear kitchen. Over the years the property had been extended to the back offering more space internally. Outside the property there is access to a shared laneway at the rear of the terrace where a block-built shed is located.\r\n\r\nWhile the house would benefit from modernisation, No. 5 offers immense potential to be the perfect home suited to a range of buyers looking for a well-located home with everyday conveniences on the doorstep.\r\n\r\nCamolin is a thriving village along the N11, popular for its easy access to both Gorey and Enniscorthy, and known for its garden centre, cafes, primary school, and active community life."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall\t\t\r\nLiving room\t                     2.9m x 4.6m\r\nBuilt-in shelving, feature fireplace, timber flooring.\r\nDining room\t                     3.1m x 2.6m\r\nHotpress, tiled flooring.\r\nKitchen\t                        2m x 2.5m\r\nTimber flooring.\r\nRear hall/Utility room\t2.4m x 2.5m\r\nTimber flooring.\r\nBedroom 1 \t\t           2.2m x 2.7m\r\nBathroom\t\t\t2.1m x 2.7m\r\nElectric shower, wetroom, bath, w.h.b, w.c.,\r\nfully tiled.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\nLanding\t\t\t\r\nBedroom 2\t\t\t2m x 2.2m\r\nBedroom 3\t\t\t3.2m x 3.6m"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tAll mains services\r\n•\tOil fired central heating\r\n•\tBlock built shed"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: E1 BER No.118603869 Energy Performance Indicator:327.86 kWh/m²/yr"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "From Gorey take the R772 following signs for Camolin. In Camolin, take the next right (for Craanford) onto Limerick Rd Lower, the property is the 5th house on the left.  Eircode: Y21 C4A4"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "By appointment only"
      }
